title Direct Child Agent Execution Through Common SessionFactory

' Source evidence (CampusClaw d649866):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/subagent/tool/SpawnAgentTool.java
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/tool/delegation/InvokeAgentTool.java
